/Title (The redesign trades some flexibilityandpossiblysmall-object accuracy for lower computation, lower power and predictable latency.Itremovesstereodepth and uses calibrated ground-plane geometry, which can become inaccurateifthecamerapole moves or the surface is not planar. It may fail when a calf is fully hiddenbehindatractor,invery dense fog, or when a person lies flat between the rails.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1235 0 R
/Next 1345 0 R
>>
endobj
1345 0 obj
<<
/Title (Final recommendation: deploy only after a field trial at each crossing, day/night/fog validation, independent railway safety review and measured proof of the false-alarm and latency limits. A false-alarm target below one per day cannot be established from a short sample; log performance over a sufficiently long operating period.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1235 0 R
/Prev 1344 0 R
>>
endobj
